<title>SINGAPORE: Liang Huat director sells 85,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Liang Huat director sells 85,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liang Huat Aluminium Ltd said on Thursday its director, Chew Kee Nam Desmond, sold 85,000 LHA shares at Singapore $0.65 each.</p>
<p>Following the sale on April 10, Chew held 363,230 shares, a company statement said.</p>
<p>Shares of the aluminium window frame maker were untraded on Thursday, with bid and ask at S$0.55 and S$0.59 respectively.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
